### Open-Source Integrity & Licensing Clarification

HIP-4 Desk is 100% free, permissive open-source software under the MIT License.
- **ZERO BUSL-1.1 Code:** It contains NO code or components from the Outcome.xyz SDK (`@outcome.xyz/hip4`, which is licensed under the restrictive Business Source License 1.1).
- **Direct Public API Integration:** All interactions with Hyperliquid are implemented cleanly via native TypeScript over official public Hyperliquid Info & Exchange REST/WebSocket endpoints.
- **Full Composability:** Freely usable, forkable, and composable by the Hyperliquid community and Colosseum hackathon participants without licensing traps or proprietary restrictions.

